Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:05.42,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,诶…这样子就能开始拍了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:07.04,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,应该可以拍了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.55,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,嗯…今天在Galaxy Popipa的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:12.51,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.41,0:00:14.68,Bang Dream-an8,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:15.16,Bang Dream,,593,0,0,,喂 香澄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:16.16,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,LOCK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.68,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,是相机啊 盯…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:21.42,Bang Dream-an8,,0,0,0,,两个人都离的太近了 太近了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:22.13,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那个不是蛮高级的货吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:23.75,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,难道是LOCK自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:25.89,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,是从老板那里借来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:29.55,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,因为是Popipa第一次公演live想留个纪念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:30.60,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:31.89,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,老板是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:33.38,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,诶 在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.19,0:00:36.73,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.19,0:00:41.06,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,好 Popipa papipo party 大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:42.95,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,一起加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:50.36,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我们staff会全力协助的 不要客气哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:53.51,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:55.51,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,这边是事先预留的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:00.04,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.24,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,没什么 想着终于到了这一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.42,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,糟糕 开始紧张了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.42,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,还有很多要做的事情哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:10.75,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:15.12,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,有咲～拜托确认一下发票
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:17.31,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那个不是我家的面包吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.31,0:01:19.06,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,阿姨交给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:21.09,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:25.14,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,茶水没问题 饮用水没问题 零食没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:26.47,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我把果汁买来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.47,0:01:27.59,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,果汁 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:32.15,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,是小兰 喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:34.82,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,需要什么东西的话 我们可以帮忙买
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.02,0:01:37.17,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,谢谢 稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.17,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,里美 零食还够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.27,0:01:40.91,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,有很多哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:42.01,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.25,0:01:43.50,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,路上小心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:48.99,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,这是相机吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:50.77,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,是哪位小猫咪的爱物呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:56.18,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,纪念视频 啊哈 好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:56.18,Bang Dream ps,,0,0,0,,请协助拍摄纪念视频
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:01:59.64,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那么三二一…happy lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:01.51,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,诶 米歇尔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:04.06,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,啊…哈…很快就会到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.26,0:02:05.68,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,哦～育美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:06.39,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,小巴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:08.15,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:10.17,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,已经穿好了衣服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:12.31,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,因为鸫她家就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.11,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:15.80,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,啊 是相机
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:16.59,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,纪念…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:18.80,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,小彩 今天的抱负是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:19.65,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,不咬舌…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.63,0:02:22.28,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,今天请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:23.37,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,请多指教的说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:26.44,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,今天我和大家都精神饱满哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:27.87,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,啊 是伊芙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:28.72,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,亚子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.95,0:02:31.50,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,你们在做什…啊 咳咳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:38.09,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,吾乃大魔姬亚子 应签订漆黑契约之人召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.09,0:02:42.60,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,今现身于此 诸君…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:43.43,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,今宵的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:46.43,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,沉醉于今宵之歌舞便可
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.52,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,现在是可乐饼time哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:49.71,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:50.65,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.65,0:02:51.49,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.89,0:02:52.85,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:53.65,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,亚子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:58.02,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,兰一脸幸福地吃着可乐饼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:02:59.48,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,摩卡…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:01.68,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,Afterglow的关系真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.68,0:03:03.53,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,好朋友～
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:04.56,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:06.73,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,真好啊 我们也
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:09.48,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,roselia也是好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:11.17,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,今天的曲奇怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:13.87,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,是不是换了种黄油 不错的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.44,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,哦～黄油…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:18.29,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,亚子也要吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:19.85,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那里也有放哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:20.71,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.42,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,真滴好次啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:23.37,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,美味
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:26.80,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,纱夜 要试试期间限定鰹鱼汤薯条吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:28.08,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我也要吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:31.74,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:34.70,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,大概是「锵」的感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.77,0:03:36.68,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,虚无缥缈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:40.11,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我觉得不错 之后再配合一遍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:40.75,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:43.78,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,对不起 米歇尔通过请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:45.45,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,虚无缥缈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:49.04,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,盯…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:57.12,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,糟糕 睁着眼睛睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:58.81,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,毕竟一直在熬夜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:01.83,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,该开始和燐子学姐一起准备着装了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.71,0:04:10.19,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,多惠你拿的太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.44,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,沙绫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:14.90,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,终于要开始了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:16.73,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,嗯 心跳加速了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:21.57,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,饮料什么的没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:23.27,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,有什么需要的尽管讲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:24.76,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,非常够
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:25.37,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,{\an8}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:27.68,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,香澄 育美也想帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:28.79,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我也来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:29.75,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:30.65,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,香澄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:31.99,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,啊 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:34.76,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,大家都是嘉宾 在这里坐着就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.23,0:04:37.99,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,香澄好努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:41.12,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我们就在live上好好加油吧 和往常一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:42.21,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:58.79,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,你不进去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:02.07,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,益木？！为什么你会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:05.27,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,这里是我家来的 那位是我老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:06.07,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,诶！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:08.14,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:10.10,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:13.96,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那身衣服果然好可爱啊 是手工制作的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.11,0:05:16.49,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,燐子学姐和我一起做的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:21.49,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:24.93,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,香澄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:25.76,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:27.16,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,今天就是你的…
Comment: 0,0:05:26.07,0:05:27.22,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.27,0:05:29.49,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,要组圆阵了 大家都进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:30.46,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,圆阵？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.15,0:05:33.69,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,诶 这么多人进不去的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:35.01,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,还请配合一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.14,0:05:47.88,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那个…从决定办公演live开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:50.20,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,发生了很多…那个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.58,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,香澄 relax relax
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:53.79,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,冷静一下再开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:06:01.41,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,今天希望大家能心跳加速 享受最棒的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:02.84,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,LOCK也进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:04.11,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,LOCK
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:05.55,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,是…是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:07.26,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那么 面带微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:08.22,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,和往常一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:09.95,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,在最棒的舞台上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:11.29,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,竭尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:13.16,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,开始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:19.36,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,Popipa pipopa Popipapapipopa
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:34.91,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到Popipa pipopa party
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.72,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我们是Poppin’Party
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.79,0:06:43.63,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,今天能光临我们的第一场公演live
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:45.26,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,希望大家能玩地愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:49.32,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那么 从最初就全心全力的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:50.96,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,请听
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:52.43,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,「Returns」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:15.74,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:18.36,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,不错的曲子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:22.20,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,曲目表上 最开始应该是「Happy Happy Party」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.79,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,从第一首歌就是高潮迭起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:27.23,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,香澄应该是太紧张了忘记了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:31.44,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,观众们…该说是情绪高涨呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:33.05,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,这是感动了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:35.06,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,正在Popi中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:38.18,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,这样不就牵不起观众的情绪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:41.80,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,这份热情可不能在一瞬就凉掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:47.44,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,以最棒的状态与Popipa交接才是展现我们实力的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:48.94,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,这就是背水一战吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:53.07,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,就交给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.05,0:08:19.33,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,扣人心弦…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.43,0:08:20.98,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,好棒的曲子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:23.83,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,香澄你吓死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.99,0:08:25.68,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我一紧张忘记了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:30.64,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,Hello Happy World
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:35.22,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,大家～Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:36.86,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,Hello～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:40.45,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,用更大的声音～Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.63,0:08:42.68,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,Lucky～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:44.22,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,Smile～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:46.66,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,Yeah～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:47.99,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,很棒的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:51.24,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,今天对于Poppin‘Party来说是特别的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.22,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,大家都露出最棒的笑容吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:58.01,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,「笑颜 Sing A Song」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:00.08,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那个不是第三首歌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.43,0:09:03.54,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,突然就来新曲了 这和曲目单不一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.55,0:10:49.90,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我们是Pastel*Palette
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:58.16,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,今天能被邀请参加Poppin’Party第一场公演live很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.65,0:11:01.88,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,刚刚的Hello Happy World的表演很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:04.06,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我们也不会输给她们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:10.52,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,接下来是最近刚发表的新曲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:17.65,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,所有人都是这么乱来的吗 我会加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:19.45,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,请听
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:21.10,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,「飞舞*flower」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:54.61,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我们是Afterglow
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:57.28,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,恭喜Poppin’party举办第一场公演live
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:58.92,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:01.95,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那我们也全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:03.30,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,新歌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:05.18,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,「ON YOUR MARK」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:48.99,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,真棒啊 Galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:51.57,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,接下来是Roselia
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:56.93,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,我们是Roselia
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:01.92,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,作为对Poppin’party的祝贺 献上此曲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:06.62,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,「Fire Bird」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:21.62,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,谢谢各位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:39.76,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,接下来这首歌 便是最后一曲了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:43.37,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,非常感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:49.10,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,虽然欢乐的时光总是转瞬即逝让人不禁心生遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:54.36,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,但是看到大家灿烂的笑容 感觉能够举办演出真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:18:00.56,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,公演live 果然非常辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:04.21,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,演出准备什么的各种各样的很多很多的琐事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:06.51,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,收到了各方人士的协助
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:09.19,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,也非常感谢光临会场的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.65,0:18:11.53,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,如果大家感到开心的话 我们就高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:18.98,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,还有就是 多惠 有咲 里美 纱夜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:25.51,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,能和大家组成Popipa真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.90,0:18:29.79,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,怎...怎么突然这么唐突
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:32.36,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,突然就想说出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.97,0:18:36.50,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那么 开始我们的演唱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:39.61,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,这首歌是由香澄作曲的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.63,0:18:43.77,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,掺杂着我们现在的心情和感受 还有梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.15,0:18:47.56,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,这是一首包含了我们所有的歌曲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:51.13,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,1 2
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:52.95,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,「Dreamers Go」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.07,0:21:08.83,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,安可 安可 安可
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:11.17,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,谢谢来自大家的安可
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:13.04,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,那么 我们就再来一首
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.69,0:22:53.88,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,真好啊 浑身打颤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.88,0:22:56.60,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,太好了 LOCK不要哭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:58.13,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,Popipa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.13,0:22:59.62,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,累死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.26,0:23:03.50,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,「Returns」刚开始的时候我还在想会变成什么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.62,0:23:07.42,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,「Fire Bird」刚开始的时候我还在想会变成什么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:09.85,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,来 CHU2大人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.85,0:23:10.57,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.79,0:23:17.16,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,不得不说你们刚才的演出有那么一瞬间把我打动了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.30,0:23:20.56,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,不过我会把你们给全数击破的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:22.04,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,给我做好觉悟哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:24.04,Bang Dream,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
